The root cause: `patches_from_postwalk` diffs AST nodes structurally but **ignores metadata** (the middle element of 3-tuples). When `fix_doc_node` only adds `:delimiter => ~s(""")` to the metadata without changing the string value, `diff_patches` sees no divergence. The fix is to use `patches_from_ast_transform` which renders+reparses, turning the metadata change into a structural one.[0m
