  def fix_patches(ast, _opts) do
    # Walk the AST manually and build patches directly rather than going
    # through `patches_from_postwalk` / `patches_from_ast_transform`.
    # Those helpers diff ASTs structurally, but `diff_patches` ignores
    # the metadata (middle) element of 3-tuples — so a change that only
    # adds `:delimiter` to the string block metadata is invisible to
    # them.  Building patches by hand lets us emit the correct range and
    # replacement text unconditionally.
